OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GOutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FOn      
OL,8,FSunday, sunny spells in the north with 
OL,9,Flight showers, but persistent rain for 
OL,10,Fthe southwest. Sunny for most on       
OL,11,FMonday, though cloud will thicken      
OL,12,Ffurther west. Rain on Tuesday.         
